OL,3,ABurnham says he will not vote on
OL,4,Aassisted dying unlike Starmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Frevealed he will not vote on the
OL,8,Fassisted dying bill for England and
OL,9,FWales unlike his predecessor Sir Keir
OL,10,FStarmer.
OL,12,FMPs are likely to get the chance to
OL,13,Fdebate and vote on the Terminally Ill
OL,14,FAdults (End of Life) Bill in two weeks'
OL,15,Ftime.
OL,17,FThe bill is identical to the one put to
OL,18,FParliament last year, where it passed
OL,19,Fin the House of Commons but stalled in
OL,20,Fthe Lords after an unprecedented number
OL,21,Fof amendments meant it ran out of time.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
