OL,3,ABurnham says he will not vote on
OL,4,Aassisted dying unlike Starmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said he has his "own personal
OL,7,Fviews on the issue" but it was "a
OL,8,Fmatter for Parliament to decide".
OL,9,FStarmer voted in favour of the previous
OL,10,Fbill when he was PM but did not
OL,11,Fcampaign in favour of it, remaining
OL,12,Fofficially neutral.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
